{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn up the heat with a flamethrower and cool off again with the chunkiest propeller engine this game has ever seen. Packing Heat contains 8x new means of adding details to your finest combat-able creations and opens up an entirely new way of shredding blueprints! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This content pack actively supports the development of Trailmakers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We carefully developed this content expansion with fairness in mind, fueled by an ambition to never have a pay-to-win-game. These blocks are designed to give you more opportunities for alternative designs while still packing a fair punch in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This pack contains:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Propeller Engine (Propulsion)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/Propellor.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This 4-Power Core spinning-beast can fit so much god damn propulsion power in it (800).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Flamethrower (Weapon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/Flamethrower.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of the few weapons of this world that doesn\u2019t really need an introduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a flamethrower. It throws flames!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Torpedo (Weapon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/Torpedo.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For too long scientists wondered \u201cwhat if kaboom but under the water\u201d and one day something came of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Small Tank Cannon (Weapon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/BuildEverything.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t let the name fool you. This short tank barrel was built for long shots and high damage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Landmine Dispenser (Weapon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/LandMine.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant mines on Great Carrier Reef (or on the Grand Prix Race Track, depending on your competitive integrity). Can detect player proximity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sea Mine Dispenser (Weapon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/Seamine.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is it a rock? Is it a piece of driftwood? Is it a spikey little ball of death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s the latter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Depth Charge Dispenser (Weapon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/Depth.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch an explosive projectile in any one of the universes\u2019 six directions with great speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Retro Stabilizer (Flight)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/Retro.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Looks old, handles like Factory new.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708690?t=1748003856","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708690?t=1748003856","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/2051910dcc3505f15b011cceaa459006829c7502/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748003856","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/2051910dcc3505f15b011cceaa459006829c7502/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748003856","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn up the heat with a flamethrower and cool off again with the chunkiest propeller engine this game has ever seen. Packing Heat contains 8x new means of adding details to your finest combat-able creations and opens up an entirely new way of shredding blueprints! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This content pack actively supports the development of Trailmakers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We carefully developed this content expansion with fairness in mind, fueled by an ambition to never have a pay-to-win-game. These blocks are designed to give you more opportunities for alternative designs while still packing a fair punch in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This pack contains:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Propeller Engine (Propulsion)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/Propellor.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This 4-Power Core spinning-beast can fit so much god damn propulsion power in it (800).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Flamethrower (Weapon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/Flamethrower.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of the few weapons of this world that doesn\u2019t really need an introduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a flamethrower. It throws flames!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Torpedo (Weapon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/Torpedo.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For too long scientists wondered \u201cwhat if kaboom but under the water\u201d and one day something came of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Small Tank Cannon (Weapon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/BuildEverything.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t let the name fool you. This short tank barrel was built for long shots and high damage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Landmine Dispenser (Weapon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/LandMine.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant mines on Great Carrier Reef (or on the Grand Prix Race Track, depending on your competitive integrity). Can detect player proximity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sea Mine Dispenser (Weapon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/Seamine.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is it a rock? Is it a piece of driftwood? Is it a spikey little ball of death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s the latter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Depth Charge Dispenser (Weapon)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/Depth.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch an explosive projectile in any one of the universes\u2019 six directions with great speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Retro Stabilizer (Flight)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/extras/Retro.png?t=1748003856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Looks old, handles like Factory new.</p>","developers":["Flashbulb"],"fullgame":{"appid":"585420","name":"Trailmakers"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708690/bfb8b654a4f40b9012e4f9786123f50a4491cac4/header.jpg?t=1748003856","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Trailmakers is copyright of Flashbulb Games 2020","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Trailmakers: Packing Heat","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"